  "description": "Brazil (ICP-Brasil, Gov.br, Lei 14.063) for the SimpleSign CLI, installed with 'simplesign extension install SimpleSign.Brazil.Cli': --profile icp-brasil and gov-br, the icp-brasil and govbr policy presets, 'simplesign brasil sign' (ICP-Brasil PAdES policies AD-RB to AD-RA, advanced electronic signatures, VALIDAR health documents), 'brasil cades sign' and 'brasil xades sign' (ICP-Brasil CAdES and XAdES policies), 'brasil fiscal sign|validate' (NF-e, CT-e, MDF-e, NFS-e, eSocial, EFD-Reinf), 'brasil timestamp verify' (ICP-Brasil ACT), and the Brazilian chain validation and Lei 14.063 level in 'validate', 'inspect', 'cades validate' and 'xades validate'.",
